  displayName: Bulwark (Tank)
  playstyle: tank
  description: 'Objective: outlast the enemy with steady offense. Fortitude +30% HP, Iron Skin -25% note damage (max 40 prevented per enemy turn), Second Wind turns overheal into shield, Tidal Healing +25% Water healing. Shield Bash hits and shields; Bulwark cuts damage 35% for 2 turns.

    Trade-off: low damage, long fights; shields are capped (30% max HP) and expire.'
